  "content": "\n\n<h2>关于</h2>\n<p>这是为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Crafts &amp; Additions</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 制作的模组附加组件。它添加了新的方块、物品、工具以及许多其他功能。</p>\n<h2>内容</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8xYg3rq/mini-cogwheel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 银矿：用于制作白金币及其他物品。&nbsp;可与金矿在同一层发现</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8xYg3rq/mini-cogwheel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 白金工具、武器与护甲套装：性能介于铁制与钻石装备之间&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8xYg3rq/mini-cogwheel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 白银与白金宝石：通过打磨锭获得。用于多种新配方</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8xYg3rq/mini-cogwheel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 利用 Create 的装配线可制作不死图腾</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8xYg3rq/mini-cogwheel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 数十种以白银和白金币为基础的新装饰方块</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8xYg3rq/mini-cogwheel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 更多功能等你探索！</p>\n<h2>截图</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HdmBJ17/1.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"637\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0K7QJBV/3.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"637\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Cm2XcZ3/2.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"637\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fktK7Y3/4.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"637\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SvY2Z7d/6.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"637\"></p>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinker's Construct</a> /&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hephaestus-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hephaestus</a></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTcHHmMC/compat.gif\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-enchantment-industry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Enchantment Industry</a></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MyLkzRMd/create-more-additions-totem3.png\" width=\"420\" height=\"275\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<p>要使所有功能正常工作，必须同时安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Crafts &amp; Additions</a>&nbsp;。</p>\n<p>推荐使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 来查看配方，但并非必需。</p>\n<h2>安装方法</h2>\n<p>将 .jar 格式的模组文件放入你的 mods&nbsp;文件夹中。</p>\n<p>或者，你也可以在 CurseForge 启动器中搜索该模组（如果找不到，请尝试输入作者名）。找到后，点击“Install”即可将其添加到你的整合包中。</p>\n<h2>权限说明</h2>\n<p>你可以自由地将此模组包含在任何公开或私有的整合包中。</p>\n<h2>支持我的工作</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vL9gzRz/image.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/robinfrt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>在 CurseForge 下载我的项目</strong></a><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FY9Qzzy/favicon-V2.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252frobinfrt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>在 Modrinth 下载我的项目</strong></a><br><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/ffeam6b7\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dXZ22AETPTQBD4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>通过 PayPal 捐赠</strong></a></p>",
